| `audio_file` |
| `tts_metadata` |
| `alignment` |
| `segments` |
| `scenes` |
| `image_prompts` |
| `storyboard_images` |
| `animation_assets` |
| `captions` |
| `music_track` |
| `editor_project` |
| `export_profile` |
| `video_file` |
| `generic_json` |

